    "notes": "Marginal source coverage, not a rectangular phase-stability field. Thermal observations span 29.5964-149.9481 GPa and 1220-2590 K; 300 K denotes the separately fitted literature reference isotherm. The paper describes a 40-150 GPa model range. All supplied rows are retained; neither FeS-VI stability nor common-model applicability below 40 GPa is asserted."
