   "notes": "One published common volume relation fitted across FeS-VI, IV and IX. This card supplies a FeS-VI Pnma diffraction structure only; it does not supply IV/IX coordinates, phase transitions, anisotropic thermal expansion or a stability map. The structural cell is measured at 56 GPa/300 K and is distinct from extrapolated EOS V0. Reported parameter errors have unspecified confidence and no covariance. The deferred integrated-MGD implementation is available only by explicitly loading this record with require_primary_validation=False; it is excluded from the normal catalog.",
